# Pairs with TypeOK. A retry moves the operation into a phase the model does
# not declare.
MODULE: TypeOkRetryUndeclaredPhase
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a retry enters an undeclared phase
PERTURBS: Retry

--- FIND
    /\ rp' = IF alias = "shadow" THEN "swapped" ELSE "built"
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: an undeclared phase.
    /\ rp' = "retrying"
--- END
